    {
      "title": "The Commandments Chronicle",
      "url": "https://note.com/letonism/n/n9669d719b827",
      "date": "Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:27:36 +0900",
      "description": "<h2 id=\"509a9cc7-1350-4a12-b453-d98d90a3e276\" name=\"509a9cc7-1350-4a12-b453-d98d90a3e276\">𝔗𝔥𝔢 𝔖𝔬𝔪𝔪𝔞𝔫𝔡𝔪𝔢𝔫𝔱𝔰 𝔖𝔥𝔯𝔬𝔫𝔦𝔠𝔩𝔢</h2><p id=\"ac5f0ab5-4c5a-4903-b02f-14ac5fd25079\" name=\"ac5f0ab5-4c5a-4903-b02f-14ac5fd25079\">The Lord did name the mountain located at forty-nine degrees, twenty-three minutes, and thirty-six seconds north latitude, and one hundred twenty-two degrees, fifty-six minutes, and forty seconds west longitude, the \"Mount Leton.\" And upon Mount Leton, the Lord bestowed unto the King Letoniu the tablets of stone whereupon the commandments were engraved.</p><br /><a href=\"https://note.com/letonism/n/n9669d719b827\">続きをみる</a>"
    },
    {
      "title": "戒律記 - The Commandments Chronicle",
      "url": "https://note.com/letonism/n/n2d6fb5a3b7fa",
      "date": "Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:21:27 +0900",
      "description": "<h2 id=\"ab86feb6-9115-4737-be66-aef87bfaa265\" name=\"ab86feb6-9115-4737-be66-aef87bfaa265\">𝔗𝔥𝔢 𝔖𝔬𝔪𝔪𝔞𝔫𝔡𝔪𝔢𝔫𝔱𝔰 𝔖𝔥𝔯𝔬𝔫𝔦𝔠𝔩𝔢</h2><p id=\"09ca5f23-461a-421f-bd91-cc482bd3e244\" name=\"09ca5f23-461a-421f-bd91-cc482bd3e244\">主は、北緯四十九度二十三分三十六秒、西経百二十二度五十六分四十秒に在る山を、レトン山と名づけ給へり。主は、レトン山において、王たるレトニウに、戒律を刻みたる石板を授け給ひき。</p><br /><a href=\"https://note.com/letonism/n/n2d6fb5a3b7fa\">続きをみる</a>"
    },
