    {
      "title": "How to Read the Scriptures",
      "url": "https://note.com/letonism/n/n552ed6238ef9",
      "date": "Tue, 18 Aug 2026 22:59:08 +0900",
      "description": "<p id=\"b95a998f-00e0-4144-bf1a-d739fa0abf28\" name=\"b95a998f-00e0-4144-bf1a-d739fa0abf28\">In the holy scriptures, several terms are employed.<br />Understanding these shall make the scriptures easier to comprehend.</p><ul id=\"708d2acc-3a6f-44b6-8948-03c255b5c4bf\" name=\"708d2acc-3a6f-44b6-8948-03c255b5c4bf\">\n<li><p id=\"86472805-c885-46c6-93ea-45193254a62d\" name=\"86472805-c885-46c6-93ea-45193254a62d\">Lord Elve -&gt; The sole and supreme God of Letonism</p></li>\n<li><p id=\"bb23b3c0-18b3-41d0-947c-3b7bfd7890ab\" name=\"bb23b3c0-18b3-41d0-947c-3b7bfd7890ab\">The Lord -&gt; Referring to Lord Elve</p></li>\n<li><p id=\"9baf3bad-9254-4a28-a043-f68d4b551311\" name=\"9baf3bad-9254-4a28-a043-f68d4b551311\">Leton -&gt; The Holy Land of Letonism</p></li>\n<li><p id=\"15c17c2a-574f-46d1-90e9-c463e51fed90\" name=\"15c17c2a-574f-46d1-90e9-c463e51fed90\">Lord-Length -&gt; Approximately 170 cm, derived from the stature of the Lord</p></li>\n</ul><br /><a href=\"https://note.com/letonism/n/n552ed6238ef9\">続きをみる</a>"
    },
    {
      "title": "聖典の読み方",
      "url": "https://note.com/letonism/n/n957e272c838d",
      "date": "Tue, 18 Aug 2026 22:57:10 +0900",
      "description": "<p id=\"d905d3a0-d187-4e77-a2d1-0d9645247ed0\" name=\"d905d3a0-d187-4e77-a2d1-0d9645247ed0\">聖典では、いくつかの用語が用いられます。<br />これらを理解すると、聖典が読みやすくなります。</p><ul id=\"c3e44321-d902-483d-8e06-01e37ad5ef8b\" name=\"c3e44321-d902-483d-8e06-01e37ad5ef8b\">\n<li><p id=\"651cd549-ce6c-4414-9562-1f20d140a87c\" name=\"651cd549-ce6c-4414-9562-1f20d140a87c\">エルヴェ様 -&gt; レトン教の唯一神</p></li>\n<li><p id=\"faeeed70-af23-4580-9876-c8dd3bb6faee\" name=\"faeeed70-af23-4580-9876-c8dd3bb6faee\">主 -&gt; エルヴェ様のこと</p></li>\n<li><p id=\"5fde16fc-5245-4afb-926f-c9eb9115edc1\" name=\"5fde16fc-5245-4afb-926f-c9eb9115edc1\">レトン -&gt; レトン教の聖地</p></li>\n<li><p id=\"9ae1e811-6a43-4369-9310-89b5c54f1ddc\" name=\"9ae1e811-6a43-4369-9310-89b5c54f1ddc\">主長 -&gt; 約170cm、主の身長に由来</p></li>\n</ul><br /><a href=\"https://note.com/letonism/n/n957e272c838d\">続きをみる</a>"
    },
